==Discord Events==
Our fantastic volunteer moderation team have already been hosting a range of fun events on our official Discord server, but we've recently expanded our focus on events and server activities further! For a brief overview: you can now suggest events you'd like to see run through the server via a new suggestions forum channel, you can opt into a new Events role to get pinged whenever there are any event updates and you can find all the information around events in a new FAQ channel.

===Launch Event: Tempoross Run===
[[File:Poll 82 Changes (6).png|400px|center]]

* '''Date:''' Saturday 10th August
* '''Time:''' from 8pm BST
* '''World:''' 358

Come and join us this Saturday as our official Discord server Chat Mods host a Tempoross Mass Run event to celebrate the launch of our Events category within the server! There'll be a channel in the Discord server set up to chat throughout the event, and you can also join the in-game friends chat: 07friends, though it's not a requirement. You'll also spot JMods there to cheer you on, as we gather to celebrate the occasion!  We'll be putting out more information in an upcoming newspost, with everything you need to know to get involved so keep your eyes peeled!

===Old School Lore Q&A Stages===
[[File:Poll 82 Changes (7).png|400px|center]]

We're brushing up on our lore knowledge with the masters themselves, Mods Ed and Errol, with Mod Blossom leading the discussion! Join us from 5pm BST on Thursday 8th August to delve into the the story and history of Gielinor. There'll be an Ask Your Questions channel to ask all the us what you want to know, plus you'll spot a post on our social channels if you'd like to add your questions there. Head to the Discord server, you'll find the Discord Stage Modcast section near the top of the channel list and when the time comes you'll be able to hop into the call and listen in. The call will be recorded and you'll be able to access the recording via Discord soon after. 

You can join the official Discord server, [http://discord.gg/OSRS here], and get stuck in!

